{"unit_id":"GLFzr__dsh-file-upload#card-zh","repo":"GLFzr/dsh-file-upload","commit":"dc23ac42271fd93814924cd5822992501f7fb654","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-upload 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的文件拖放插件。它在 Web 页面接管文件拖放，通过宿主上传路由把文件分块写入本机 dropbox，并把路径作为 composer 中的文件引用 chip 插入；Chromium 可用时也能直接引用本机路径。主要功能包括多文件拖放、上传与去重、输入框引用插入，以及侧边栏上传目录清理。适合需要让 DSH agent 读取本机文件的 Web 用户；可通过 DSH_DROPBOX_DIR 指定保存目录，否则使用用户主目录下的 .dsh-dropbox。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-8","lib/index.js:264-272","lib/client.js:360-418","lib/client.js:478-486","lib/client.js:823-863"]}
{"unit_id":"GLFzr__dsh-file-upload#card-en","repo":"GLFzr/dsh-file-upload","commit":"dc23ac42271fd93814924cd5822992501f7fb654","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-upload adds file drops to DSH Web. It uploads files locally or uses Chromium paths, then inserts references in the composer. Users can drop multiple files and clean uploaded files from the sidebar. DSH_DROPBOX_DIR selects storage; otherwise it uses .dsh-dropbox in the user home directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-8","lib/index.js:264-272","lib/client.js:360-418","lib/client.js:478-486","lib/client.js:823-863"]}
