{"unit_id":"GLFzr__dsh-file-upload#feature-1","repo":"GLFzr/dsh-file-upload","commit":"dc23ac42271fd93814924cd5822992501f7fb654","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-upload 的功能「拖放并插入文件引用」：在 DSH Web 页面拖入文件后，优先引用 Chromium 本机路径，否则分块上传；完成后将路径作为整体 chip 插入 composer。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:360-418","lib/client.js:478-486"]}
{"unit_id":"GLFzr__dsh-file-upload#feature-2","repo":"GLFzr/dsh-file-upload","commit":"dc23ac42271fd93814924cd5822992501f7fb654","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-upload 的功能「重复文件去重」：上传开始时可按名称、大小和源修改时间复用已有文件；完整上传后再按内容哈希判断相同文件并复用路径，避免重复保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:313-345","lib/index.js:370-400","lib/index.js:428-458"]}
